{"id":"a4239c0a6290ab42","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-partial-trace.md","title":"Partial Trace","display":"df-partial-trace — Partial Trace","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-partial-trace","aliases":["58-df-partial-trace"],"display":"df-partial-trace — Partial Trace","depends_on":["[[58-df-tensor-product]]","[[58-df-density-matrix]]","[[58-df-trace-class]]","[[58-df-bounded-operator]]","[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","[[58-df-composite]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-partial-trace"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-partial-trace</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-partial-trace — Partial Trace"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cae2c5219270d535\" href=\"?note=cae2c5219270d535\" title=\"58-df-tensor-product\">58-df-tensor-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f9fa657af9512258\" href=\"?note=f9fa657af9512258\" title=\"58-df-density-matrix\">58-df-density-matrix</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cb6f3da63e39a685\" href=\"?note=cb6f3da63e39a685\" title=\"58-df-trace-class\">58-df-trace-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"2ad9c248fe18df37\" href=\"?note=2ad9c248fe18df37\" title=\"58-df-bounded-operator\">58-df-bounded-operator</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b70ce791d5b1a19b\" href=\"?note=b70ce791d5b1a19b\" title=\"58-df-hilbert-space\">58-df-hilbert-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a8591aa671cf9030\" href=\"?note=a8591aa671cf9030\" title=\"58-df-composite\">58-df-composite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_A,H_B,H_{AB},\\rho_{AB},\\rho_B,\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB},\\operatorname{Tr}_B\\in V\">\\(H_A,H_B,H_{AB},\\rho_{AB},\\rho_B,\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB},\\operatorname{Tr}_B\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B_A,B_B,B_{AB}\">\\(B_A,B_B,B_{AB}\\)</span> 为同一次关系调用中的内积见证；对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,\\mathbb C,+,\\odot)\">\\(\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,\\mathbb C,+,\\odot)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu_B=\\{\\langle x,\\sqrt{B(\\langle x,x\\rangle)}\\rangle:x\\in H\\}\">\\(\\nu_B=\\{\\langle x,\\sqrt{B(\\langle x,x\\rangle)}\\rangle:x\\in H\\}\\)</span>。二元写法 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B(x,y)\">\\(B(x,y)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau(x,y)\">\\(\\tau(x,y)\\)</span> 是相应有序对函数应用的缩写。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S(\\rho,H,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S(\\rho,H,B)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(A,H,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(A,H,B)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S(t,A,H,B)\">\\(\\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S(t,A,H,B)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Composite}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Composite}_S\\)</span> are used with their exact structure-sensitive signatures</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertTensorStructure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertTensorStructure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensorLift}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{TensorLift}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{OperatorTraceFunctional}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{OperatorTraceFunctional}_S\\)</span> are defined below</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PartialTrace}_S(\\rho_B,\\rho_{AB};H_A,H_B,\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB},\\operatorname{Tr}_B)\">\\(\\mathrm{PartialTrace}_S(\\rho_B,\\rho_{AB};H_A,H_B,\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB},\\operatorname{Tr}_B)\\)</span> (compatibility predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}\">\\(\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"cae2c5219270d535\" href=\"?note=cae2c5219270d535\" title=\"58-df-tensor-product\">58-df-tensor-product</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{HilbertTensorStructure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(H_{AB},B_{AB},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB},j,\\tau;H_A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A;H_B,B_B,+_B,\\odot_B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H_A,B_A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H_B,B_B,\\mathbb C,+_B,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists A,B_0,+_0,\\odot_0\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}_S(A,+_0,\\odot_0,\\tau;H_A,+_A,\\odot_A,H_B,+_B,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}_S(B_0;A,+_0,\\odot_0,\\tau,H_A,B_A,H_B,B_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}_S(H_{AB},B_{AB},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB},j;A,B_0,+_0,\\odot_0)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{HilbertTensorStructure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(H_{AB},B_{AB},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB},j,\\tau;H_A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A;H_B,B_B,+_B,\\odot_B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H_A,B_A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H_B,B_B,\\mathbb C,+_B,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists A,B_0,+_0,\\odot_0\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}_S(A,+_0,\\odot_0,\\tau;H_A,+_A,\\odot_A,H_B,+_B,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}_S(B_0;A,+_0,\\odot_0,\\tau,H_A,B_A,H_B,B_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}_S(H_{AB},B_{AB},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB},j;A,B_0,+_0,\\odot_0)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}trace\\text{-}tensor\\text{-}lift}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{TensorLift}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(L,S;j,\\tau,H_A,H_B,H_{AB})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(L,H_{AB},H_{AB})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S,H_B,H_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in H_A\\;\\forall y\\in H_B\\;\nL\\bigl(j(\\tau(x,y))\\bigr)=j\\bigl(\\tau(x,S(y))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}trace\\text{-}tensor\\text{-}lift}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{TensorLift}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(L,S;j,\\tau,H_A,H_B,H_{AB})\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(L,H_{AB},H_{AB})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S,H_B,H_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in H_A\\;\\forall y\\in H_B\\;\nL\\bigl(j(\\tau(x,y))\\bigr)=j\\bigl(\\tau(x,S(y))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}trace\\text{-}functional}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OperatorTraceFunctional}_S(\\operatorname{Tr},H,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{Tr},\n\\{A\\in H^H:\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(A,H,B)\\},\\mathbb C\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in H^H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(A,H,B)\n\\to\\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S(\\operatorname{Tr}(A),A,H,B)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}trace\\text{-}functional}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OperatorTraceFunctional}_S(\\operatorname{Tr},H,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{Tr},\n\\{A\\in H^H:\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(A,H,B)\\},\\mathbb C\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in H^H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(A,H,B)\n\\to\\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S(\\operatorname{Tr}(A),A,H,B)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}trace}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PartialTrace}_S(\\rho_B,\\rho_{AB};H_A,H_B,\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB},\\operatorname{Tr}_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists H_{AB},B_A,B_B,B_{AB},+_A,\\odot_A,+_B,\\odot_B,+_{AB},\\odot_{AB},j,\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{HilbertTensorStructure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(H_{AB},B_{AB},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB},j,\\tau;H_A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A;H_B,B_B,+_B,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S(\\rho_{AB},H_{AB},B_{AB})\n\\land\\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S(\\rho_B,H_B,B_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{OperatorTraceFunctional}_S(\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB},H_{AB},B_{AB})\n\\land\\mathrm{OperatorTraceFunctional}_S(\\operatorname{Tr}_B,H_B,B_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall S\\in H_B^{H_B}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(S;H_B,\\nu_{B_B},+_B,\\odot_B;H_B,\\nu_{B_B},+_B,\\odot_B;\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{23mm}\\to\\exists L,U_B,U_{AB}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TensorLift}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(L,S;j,\\tau,H_A,H_B,H_{AB})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(L;H_{AB},\\nu_{B_{AB}},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB};H_{AB},\\nu_{B_{AB}},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB};\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\mathrm{Composite}_S(U_B,\\rho_B,S,H_B,H_B,H_B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Composite}_S(U_{AB},\\rho_{AB},L,H_{AB},H_{AB},H_{AB})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(U_B,H_B,B_B)\n\\land\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(U_{AB},H_{AB},B_{AB})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\operatorname{Tr}_B(U_B)=\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB}(U_{AB})\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}trace}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PartialTrace}_S(\\rho_B,\\rho_{AB};H_A,H_B,\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB},\\operatorname{Tr}_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists H_{AB},B_A,B_B,B_{AB},+_A,\\odot_A,+_B,\\odot_B,+_{AB},\\odot_{AB},j,\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\mathrm{HilbertTensorStructure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(H_{AB},B_{AB},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB},j,\\tau;H_A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A;H_B,B_B,+_B,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S(\\rho_{AB},H_{AB},B_{AB})\n\\land\\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S(\\rho_B,H_B,B_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{OperatorTraceFunctional}_S(\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB},H_{AB},B_{AB})\n\\land\\mathrm{OperatorTraceFunctional}_S(\\operatorname{Tr}_B,H_B,B_B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall S\\in H_B^{H_B}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(S;H_B,\\nu_{B_B},+_B,\\odot_B;H_B,\\nu_{B_B},+_B,\\odot_B;\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{23mm}\\to\\exists L,U_B,U_{AB}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TensorLift}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(L,S;j,\\tau,H_A,H_B,H_{AB})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(L;H_{AB},\\nu_{B_{AB}},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB};H_{AB},\\nu_{B_{AB}},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB};\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\mathrm{Composite}_S(U_B,\\rho_B,S,H_B,H_B,H_B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Composite}_S(U_{AB},\\rho_{AB},L,H_{AB},H_{AB},H_{AB})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(U_B,H_B,B_B)\n\\land\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(U_{AB},H_{AB},B_{AB})\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\operatorname{Tr}_B(U_B)=\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB}(U_{AB})\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The trace-pairing characterization is basis independent.  Both trace functionals are now tied to the exact operator-trace relation on explicit trace-class domains, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_{H_A}\\otimes S\">\\(I_{H_A}\\otimes S\\)</span> is replaced by an explicitly typed bounded tensor lift.</li>\n<li>The legacy six-argument interface is retained, while the tensor carrier and all Hilbert structures are existential witnesses internal to the definition.</li>\n<li>It gives reduced density matrices in composite systems.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-tensor-product","status":"resolved","id":"cae2c5219270d535","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-tensor-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-density-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"f9fa657af9512258","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-density-matrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-trace-class","status":"resolved","id":"cb6f3da63e39a685","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-trace-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-bounded-operator","status":"resolved","id":"2ad9c248fe18df37","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-bounded-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-hilbert-space","status":"resolved","id":"b70ce791d5b1a19b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-hilbert-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-composite","status":"resolved","id":"a8591aa671cf9030","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-composite]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-tensor-product","status":"resolved","id":"cae2c5219270d535","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}$、$\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}$、$\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}$ 取 [[58-df-tensor-product]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H_A,H_B,H_{AB},\\rho_{AB},\\rho_B,\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB},\\operatorname{Tr}_B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"B_A,B_B,B_{AB}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InnerProduct}_S(B,H,\\mathbb C,+,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu_B=\\{\\langle x,\\sqrt{B(\\langle x,x\\rangle)}\\rangle:x\\in H\\}","display":false},{"tex":"B(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau(x,y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S(\\rho,H,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(A,H,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S(t,A,H,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Composite}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertTensorStructure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensorLift}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{OperatorTraceFunctional}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PartialTrace}_S(\\rho_B,\\rho_{AB};H_A,H_B,\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB},\\operatorname{Tr}_B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{HilbertTensorStructure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(H_{AB},B_{AB},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB},j,\\tau;H_A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A;H_B,B_B,+_B,\\odot_B)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H_A,B_A,\\mathbb C,+_A,\\odot_A)\n\\land\\mathrm{HilbertSpace}_S(H_B,B_B,\\mathbb C,+_B,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&\\land\\exists A,B_0,+_0,\\odot_0\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{AlgebraicTensorData}_S(A,+_0,\\odot_0,\\tau;H_A,+_A,\\odot_A,H_B,+_B,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{TensorInnerProductData}_S(B_0;A,+_0,\\odot_0,\\tau,H_A,B_A,H_B,B_B)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{HilbertCompletionData}_S(H_{AB},B_{AB},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB},j;A,B_0,+_0,\\odot_0)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}trace\\text{-}tensor\\text{-}lift}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{TensorLift}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(L,S;j,\\tau,H_A,H_B,H_{AB})\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}(L,H_{AB},H_{AB})\\land\\mathrm{Function}(S,H_B,H_B)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall x\\in H_A\\;\\forall y\\in H_B\\;\nL\\bigl(j(\\tau(x,y))\\bigr)=j\\bigl(\\tau(x,S(y))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}trace\\text{-}functional}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{OperatorTraceFunctional}_S(\\operatorname{Tr},H,B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(\\operatorname{Tr},\n\\{A\\in H^H:\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(A,H,B)\\},\\mathbb C\\right)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall A\\in H^H\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(A,H,B)\n\\to\\mathrm{OperatorTrace}_S(\\operatorname{Tr}(A),A,H,B)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}partial\\text{-}trace}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\mathrm{PartialTrace}_S(\\rho_B,\\rho_{AB};H_A,H_B,\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB},\\operatorname{Tr}_B)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists H_{AB},B_A,B_B,B_{AB},+_A,\\odot_A,+_B,\\odot_B,+_{AB},\\odot_{AB},j,\\tau\\in V\\;\\Bigl[\\\\\n&\\qquad\\mathrm{HilbertTensorStructure}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n(H_{AB},B_{AB},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB},j,\\tau;H_A,B_A,+_A,\\odot_A;H_B,B_B,+_B,\\odot_B)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S(\\rho_{AB},H_{AB},B_{AB})\n\\land\\mathrm{DensityMatrix}_S(\\rho_B,H_B,B_B)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{OperatorTraceFunctional}_S(\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB},H_{AB},B_{AB})\n\\land\\mathrm{OperatorTraceFunctional}_S(\\operatorname{Tr}_B,H_B,B_B)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall S\\in H_B^{H_B}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(S;H_B,\\nu_{B_B},+_B,\\odot_B;H_B,\\nu_{B_B},+_B,\\odot_B;\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&\\hspace{23mm}\\to\\exists L,U_B,U_{AB}\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{TensorLift}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(L,S;j,\\tau,H_A,H_B,H_{AB})\\\\\n&\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\mathrm{BoundedOperatorStructure}_S\n(L;H_{AB},\\nu_{B_{AB}},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB};H_{AB},\\nu_{B_{AB}},+_{AB},\\odot_{AB};\\mathbb C)\\\\\n&\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\mathrm{Composite}_S(U_B,\\rho_B,S,H_B,H_B,H_B)\n\\land\\mathrm{Composite}_S(U_{AB},\\rho_{AB},L,H_{AB},H_{AB},H_{AB})\\\\\n&\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(U_B,H_B,B_B)\n\\land\\mathrm{TraceClassStructure}_S(U_{AB},H_{AB},B_{AB})\\\\\n&\\hspace{37mm}\\land\\operatorname{Tr}_B(U_B)=\\operatorname{Tr}_{AB}(U_{AB})\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr)\n\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"I_{H_A}\\otimes S","display":false}],"bytes":4930,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-944","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-partial-trace.md|58-df-partial-trace]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["cae2c5219270d535","f9fa657af9512258","cb6f3da63e39a685","2ad9c248fe18df37","b70ce791d5b1a19b","a8591aa671cf9030","36d7463d215be751"]}